SUMMARY:[Curated Role Feeds] Draft 2026 Marine Mammal Stock Assessment Rep
 orts
DESCRIPTION:NMFS reviewed the Alaska\, Atlantic\, and Pacific regional mar
 ine mammal stock assessment reports (SARs) in accordance with the Marine M
 ammal Protection Act (MMPA). SARs for marine mammals in all three regions 
 were revised to include new information. NMFS is soliciting public comment
 s on the draft 2026 SARs. We will consider all comments that are received 
 by the close of the comment period.\nhttps://www.federalregister.gov/docum
 ents/2026/11/20/2026-23682/draft-2026-marine-mammal-stock-assessment-repor
 ts
