DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261109
SUMMARY:[Curated Role Feeds] Policy Statement on Jurisdiction and Preempti
 on Under the ICC Termination Act
DESCRIPTION:The Surface Transportation Board (STB or Board) is issuing thi
 s policy statement on the scope of its jurisdiction over transportation by
  rail carriers and on preemption of conflicting state and federal laws und
 er the ICC Termination Act of 1995 (ICCTA). The policy statement provides 
 an overview of the Board's jurisdiction and preemption through a review of
  existing legal precedent\, discussing many commonly occurring questions. 
 The Board intends the policy statement to serve as a useful tool for the p
 ublic to review\, in one place\, concise explanations from the Board about
  its jurisdiction and application of preemption\, which the Board anticipa
 tes will reduce confusion and facilitate the efficient resolution of dispu
 tes.\nhttps://www.federalregister.gov/documents/2026/11/09/2026-22811/poli
 cy-statement-on-jurisdiction-and-preemption-under-the-icc-termination-act
URL:https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/2026/11/09/2026-22811/policy
 -statement-on-jurisdiction-and-preemption-under-the-icc-termination-act
